    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Kronborg Castle, renamed in the 1570s by King Frederik II, now stands as a UNESCO World Heritage site on the island of Zealand.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Helsing%C3%B8r"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Since 1937, the castle’s courtyard has hosted an annual Hamlet performance, drawing audiences from around the world.",
